\b What was done\b0\par
\bullet SmartInventory.storekit: verified introductoryOffer is FreeTrial period=1 periodUnit=Week (7 days) on BOTH monthly and annual - already correct, no duration change needed. Fixed product IDs, which were com.vishuddhi.smartinventory.* while the code requests com.vishuddhi.stoqly.*; the scheme loads this file, so loadProducts() could never match it. Removed hardcoded "~$1.92/month" from the annual description.\par
