\bullet FirestoreManager.swift: added setManualProUntil(_:) and clearManualProUntil(ifMatching:). No new Firestore field - manualProUntil reused per spec.\par
\bullet AnalyticsManager.swift: added trial_started{plan, ends_at, source}, trial_converted{plan, days_used}, trial_cancelled{plan, days_used}, trial_expired{plan} to the StoqlyEvent taxonomy. paywall_shown, paywall_cta_tapped and subscription_started were NOT modified.\par
\bullet PaywallView (in SubscriptionManager.swift): added TrialHeaderBanner "7-day free trial - cancel anytime" above the plan buttons, "Then %@/month" / "Then %@/year" subtitles on each plan card, and the auto-renew legal line. Every price comes from product.displayPrice.\par
\bullet AIInventoryService.swift: both "no free trial" system-prompt lines replaced with the 7-day trial wording; added an instruction never to quote a price since prices vary by storefront.\par
